gogv
====

This project is a Go implementation of the Graphviz `dot` program
(https://graphviz.org). It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Graphviz
project.

Clean-room origin
-----------------

gogv is written from published papers, the Graphviz documentation and the
observed behavior of Graphviz 16.1.0 used as a black box. It contains no code
from Graphviz or from its ports and bindings. Every Go source file names its
sources in "Provenance:" header lines:

    Provenance: original                  original work of this project
    Provenance: paper <citation>          a published paper
    Provenance: doc <URL>                 a page of the Graphviz documentation
    Provenance: observed dot 16.1.0       the observed behavior of Graphviz dot
    Provenance: gopuml <path>             code taken from gopuml
                                          (https://github.com/ekalinin/gopuml,
